===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Any of various large [[insect]]s from the family {{taxfmt|Gryllotalpidae|family}} that burrow into moist soil and feed on plant roots.
#: {{syn|en|fen cricket|q1=UK dialect}}
#* {{quote-book|en|author=w:Jan Morris|title=Spain|publisher=Faber and Faber|isbn=978-0-571-24787-5|year=1964|year_published=2008|chapter=Wild Spain|passage=Spain is full of '''mole-crickets''', shrill little underground insects whose goggle eyes you may sometimes see peering sleeplessly out of their burrows, and whose buzz is so energetic that their whole bodies vibrate down there like the radiators of very old motor-cars.}}

